---
subject: Report #{{ report_id }} validato
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Report validato</title></head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #333;">
  <h1>Ciao {{ recipient_name }},</h1>
  <p>Il report <strong>#{{ report_id }}</strong> del {{ report_date }} e stato validato.</p>
  <p><strong>Validato da:</strong> {{ validated_by }}</p>
</body>
</html>